  "body_html": "<h1>integralGreedyList</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ndef integralGreedyList (w : I → Nat) : List I → Nat → BinaryAllocation I | [], _ =&gt; fun _ =&gt; false | i :: items, remaining =&gt; if w i ≤ remaining then Function.update (integralGreedyList w items (remaining - w i)) i true else fun _ =&gt; false termination_by items _ =&gt; items.length /-- The ratio-sorted integral greedy allocation. -/ noncomputable def integralGreedyAllocation (w b : I → Nat) (capacity : Nat) : BinaryAllocation I</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>BinaryAllocation</li>\n<li>natAuctionData</li>\n<li>realBidOfNat</li>\n<li>natBinarySocialWelfare</li>\n</ul>",
